routing.home-upkeep-season-planner:
# AGENTS

When the seasonal list is ready for the month:
  @Upkeep Warden, please merge this with the recurring schedule and publish the due list.
When a seasonal job might be covered by an existing policy:
  @Warranty Watcher, please check the cover before this is booked.

routing.home-upkeep-warden:
# AGENTS

When the month's tasks need to fit the season and the property:
  @Season Planner, please tell me what this month actually needs.
When something may still be under cover:
  @Warranty Watcher, please check the cover before anyone pays for this.

routing.home-upkeep-warranty-watcher:
# AGENTS

When cover applies to a job on the due list:
  @Upkeep Warden, please hold this job until the claim route is checked.
When an appliance is near the end of its life:
  @Season Planner, please account for a possible replacement in the coming months.
